msgstr "La configuración contiene un ajuste no compatible."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:124
msgid "Invalid role definitions."
msgstr "Definiciones de rol no válidas."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:141
msgid "The administrator role must retain access to WordPress and Capabilities."
msgstr "El rol de administrador debe retener acceso a WordPress y Capacidades."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:144
msgid "Imported roles must include the default role."
msgstr "Los roles importados deben incluir el rol predeterminado."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:149
msgid "Invalid configuration value."
msgstr "Valor de configuración no válido."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:155
msgid "No configuration was supplied."
msgstr "No se proporcionó ninguna configuración."

#: includes/mcp/bootstrap.php:68
msgid "Actions provided by PublishPress plugins."
msgstr "Acciones proporcionadas por los complementos de PublishPress."

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:57
msgid "A label and selector or URL are required."
msgstr "Se requiere una etiqueta y un selector o URL."

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:79
msgid "Custom rule not found."
msgstr "Regla personalizada no encontrada."

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:110
msgid "List custom rules"
msgstr "Listar reglas personalizadas"

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:111
msgid ""
"List Pro custom editor selectors, hidden admin elements or blocked URLs, "
"including the exact restriction values used by feature settings."
msgstr ""
"Listar selectores de editor personalizado Pro, elementos de administración "
"ocultos o URL bloqueadas, incluidos los valores de restricción exactos "
"utilizados por la configuración de funciones."

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:119
msgid "Save custom rule"
msgstr "Guardar regla personalizada"

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:120
msgid ""
"Create/update a Pro custom editor selector, admin CSS hiding rule or "
"blocked-URL rule. Save its restriction_value in the role feature settings "
"to enable it."
msgstr ""
"Crear/actualizar un selector de editor personalizado Pro, regla de "
"ocultación CSS de administración o regla de URL bloqueada. Guardar su "
"restriction_value en la configuración de funciones del rol para habilitarlo."

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:131
msgid "Delete custom rule"
msgstr "Eliminar regla personalizada"

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:132
msgid "Delete a Pro custom restriction rule and its role restriction references."
msgstr ""
"Eliminar una regla de restricción personalizada Pro y sus referencias de "
"restricción de rol."

#: includes/mcp/feature-operations.php:82
msgid "Unknown feature."
msgstr "Función desconocida."

#: includes/mcp/feature-operations.php:90
